<div class="page-width" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 5%;">
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
    {% style %}
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important; }
      }
    {% endstyle %}
    <div class="story-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Our Story</h1>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Velour was born out of a desire to create clothing that transcends fleeting trends. Founded in 2024, our mission has always been to craft timeless pieces using the finest materials available.</p>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We believe in quality over quantity. Every stitch, every seam, and every fabric choice is meticulously considered to ensure our garments not only look beautiful but last a lifetime.</p>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">Our design philosophy is rooted in minimalism, offering versatile staples that effortlessly elevate your everyday wardrobe.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445205170230-053b83016050?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Fashion design process" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
